@startuml
title ChatHealthy.ai — end to end: from the operator's deploy to a user's answer

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #0b7a75
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #0b7a75
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #6b7280
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #f3f4f6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9ca3af

actor "User" as USER

package "Operator's Workstation" #fdfdfd {
  [Claude Code + engineering rules\ncommit authorization · git hooks;\nthe governed human-in-the-loop] as OGOV
  [build_chathealthy.py\nstages one dir per target / package] as OBUILD
  [deploy_chathealthy.py\ninstalls packages · writes the live map] as ODEPLOY
  [promote_chathealthy.py\nlocal -> dev -> qa -> prod] as OPROMOTE
}

package "The browser" #fdfdfd {
  [Wrapper site\nCloudflare Pages · static] as WRAP
  [ClientRouter] as CR
  [Widgets\none per frame] as W
}

package "SharedServices  ·  Hugging Face Space" #fdfdfd {
  [Gate\na facade — the one entrance;\nthe only node that knows transport;\nproxy for the navigator] as GATE
  [UniversalNavigator\nreads the map, drives the route,\nledger · merge · sessions · security;\nthe only node that takes outside traffic] as UN
  [UtteranceManager\nutterance -> the set of tools to dispatch to;\npreamble + fragments, one model call;\ndecides sufficiency + dispatches to >=1 tool;\ncapability: RequestUsersRefinement — the one\nconversational surface, never a tool direct;\nRequestUsersRefinement() — UM's own LLM authors\nthe question (no route / missing slot);\nRequestUsersRefinement(question) — delivers a\ndispatched tool's question] as UM
}

package "FindCare  ·  Hugging Face Space" #fdfdfd {
  [UniversalNavigatorProxy\nrelays tool-to-tool both ways] as FCPX
  [individualProvider — page\nProviderSearch (required) · SpecialtyFilter\n(Prescribers / Homeopathic) · Geo ·\nProviderDetail · ProviderSelection] as FCP
  [facility — page\nFacilitySearch (required) · facility NUCC filter\n(Ambulatory / Psychiatric / Inpatient) · Geo ·\nFacilityDetail] as FCF
  [clinicalTrial — page\nClinicalTrials (required) · Geo] as FCT
}

package "EvaluateCare  ·  Hugging Face Space" #fdfdfd {
  [UniversalNavigatorProxy\nrelays tool-to-tool both ways] as ECPX
  [Scoring and ranking] as EC
}

database "MongoDB (Atlas) — front end" as FE {
  [ToolRegistry (ChatHealthyToolRegistrySchema)\ntools · routes · pages;\ninstance{build,commit,env,live}] as REG
  [Registered Users\nOAuth identities · profiles · consent] as USERS
  [Session\nsession token · render ledger] as SESS
  [PublicHealthData] as PHD
}

database "MongoDB (Atlas) — pipelines" as PIPE {
  [PipelinePublicHealthData] as PPHD
}

package "Azure" #fdfdfd {
  package "Data Pipelines · Automation" as AUTO {
    [Provider load\nNPPES full loads] as PLOAD
    [Enrichment\ncounty · urban · specialty] as PENR
    [Migration\nrelease-only] as PMIG
    [Reaper\ncluster uptime] as PREAP
    [Regression reports] as PREP
  }
  package "Workflow Manager · Job Manager" as WFM {
    [Runbooks] as WRUN
    [Schedules] as WSCH
    [Webhooks] as WHOOK
  }
  package "Key Vault" as KV {
    [CA root signing cert] as KVROOT
    [Service certificates\ngate · proxies] as KVCERT
    [Secrets by vault name] as KVSEC
  }
  package "Entra ID" as ENTRA {
    [Service identities\nclaudeCodeAgent · frontendUser] as ENID
    [Groups · role grants] as ENGRP
    [Conditional access · MFA] as ENCA
  }
}

component "ChatHealthyLib\ntool contract · exceptions · logging ·\ndatabase access · model facade ·\nthe deterministic merge" as LIB #eef6f5

' --- the operator's governed deploy spine ---
OGOV -right-> OBUILD : rules gate every commit
OBUILD -right-> ODEPLOY : build output
ODEPLOY -right-> OPROMOTE : promote the baseline
OGOV ..> ENID : authenticates (claudeCodeAgent)
ODEPLOY ..> KVSEC : reads secrets by vault name
ODEPLOY ..> WRUN : installs runbooks and schedules
ODEPLOY ..> REG : the deploy writes the live map
ODEPLOY ..> GATE : deploys the Hugging Face spaces

' --- the user logs in ---
USER -down-> WRAP : logs in via OAuth\n(Google · Apple · Facebook)

' --- the request spine ---
WRAP -right-> CR
CR -right-> W
CR -down-> GATE : every call, one POST
GATE -down-> UN : token, head, params
UN -right-> UM : classify the utterance
FCP ..> UM : RequestUsersRefinement(question)

' --- dispatch across the wire to the satellites ---
UN -right-> FCPX : dispatch
UN -down-> ECPX : dispatch
FCPX -down-> FCP
FCPX -down-> FCF
FCPX -down-> FCT
ECPX -down-> EC

' --- what the navigator reads and writes ---
UN -down-> REG : reads the live map at startup
UN -down-> SESS : session token, render ledger
UN -down-> USERS : OAuth login — create / verify the user
FCP -down-> PHD
FCF -down-> PHD
FCT -right-> [clinicaltrials.gov] : not ours

' --- pipelines and the release-only migration ---
PLOAD -up-> PPHD : full load
PENR -up-> PPHD : enrich
PMIG -up-> PPHD : reads
PMIG ..> PHD : migration, on release only
WSCH ..> PLOAD : scheduled trigger

' --- identity binds the credential ---
KVCERT ..> GATE : issues certificates
KVCERT ..> FCPX : issues certificates
KVCERT ..> ECPX : issues certificates
ENID ..> KVCERT : the identity a certificate binds

' --- shared library, anchored once; the note carries the rest ---
LIB .up.> UN

note right of GATE
  Knows transport exists; nothing else does.
  Collects the session token, the HTTP head
  and the POST/GET parameters, hands them to
  the navigator, and streams the one answer
  back. A finished tool answers as an internal
  callback the navigator sequences onto that stream.
end note

note bottom of UN
  Holds no data of its own: the map is the
  registry, parameters ride the passed document,
  sessions and the ledger are rows. Five call
  types enter, all mapped: tool-to-tool,
  third-party callback, static witness,
  client-sessioned, internal callback.
end note

note bottom of UM
  RequestUsersRefinement is a CAPABILITY of the
  UtteranceManager, not a separate tool, and it is
  the single conversational surface — no tool ever
  talks to the user directly. The UM decides whether
  an utterance is sufficient to dispatch to one or
  more tools, and dispatches if so. RequestUsersRefinement()
  has the UM's own LLM author the question when there is
  no dispatchable route or a slot is missing;
  RequestUsersRefinement(question) delivers a question a
  dispatched tool authored. Approved requirements place
  both inside the UM: EPIC-002-F-010-S-001 (author
  user_message), EPIC-002-F-010-S-003 (the manufacture
  path), EPIC-006-F-008-S-003 (a parameter writer).
end note

note bottom of LIB
  Linked by every component — the gate, every
  tool, and both proxies. The navigator is
  built in-house; pydantic-ai carries the
  model call inside tools.
end note

note bottom of PPHD
  Data reaches the front end only by migration,
  and only when a person releases it.
end note

note bottom of KVCERT
  Issues certificates to the gate and to both
  proxies; holds every secret by vault name.
end note

note bottom of FCP
  Three pages only: individualProvider, facility,
  clinicalTrial. Detail views, the specialty / NUCC
  filter and Geo are page-scoped MEMBERS, never pages.
  Geo runs parallel to the specialty filter on
  individualProvider + facility, resolving free-text
  geography (incl. misspellings). The facility NUCC
  filter mirrors the individual Prescribers / Homeopathic
  filter.
end note
@enduml
